@startuml
title SIC/XE Simulator - Runtime Architecture Plugin Model

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

' ============================================================
' Backend Process
' ============================================================

node "Backend Process" as Backend {
    component "ArchitectureManager" as ArchitectureManager
    component "SharedLoader" as SharedLoader
    component "LoadedArchitecture" as LoadedArchitecture
}

' ============================================================
' Architecture Plugins
' ============================================================

folder "bin/archs/" as ArchDirectory {
    artifact "libsic-xe.dll" as SicXeDLL
    artifact "lib<architecture>.(dll|so|dylib)" as ArchitectureDLL
}

' ============================================================
' Plugin API
' ============================================================

interface "Architecture API / ABI" as ArchitectureAPI

note left of ArchitectureAPI
    **Exported symbols**
    + architecture_api_version
    + architecture_name
    + architecture_create()
    + architecture_destroy()
    + architecture_reset()
    + architecture_step()
    + architecture_get_register()
end note

' ============================================================
' Host-side relationships
' ============================================================

ArchitectureManager --> SharedLoader : discover / load
ArchitectureManager --> LoadedArchitecture : manages
SharedLoader --> LoadedArchitecture : creates / initializes
SharedLoader ..> ArchDirectory : scans and loads\nshared libraries

' ============================================================
' Runtime library relationship
' ============================================================

LoadedArchitecture ..> ArchitectureAPI : resolves symbols
LoadedArchitecture --> SicXeDLL : holds handle
LoadedArchitecture --> ArchitectureDLL : holds handle

SicXeDLL ..|> ArchitectureAPI
ArchitectureDLL ..|> ArchitectureAPI

' ============================================================
' Notes
' ============================================================

note right of ArchitectureManager
    Responsible for:
    - discovering architectures
    - selecting architecture
    - loading / unloading plugins
    - managing loaded architectures
end note

note right of SharedLoader
    RAII wrapper around
    platform dynamic loading.

    Windows:
        LoadLibrary / GetProcAddress

    Linux:
        dlopen / dlsym
end note

note right of LoadedArchitecture
    Runtime representation of
    a loaded architecture.

    Stores the dynamic library
    handle and resolved symbols.
end note

note bottom of ArchDirectory
    Architecture plugins are portable
    shared libraries.

    The backend searches:

        bin/archs/

    and loads the architecture
    selected by the project.
end note

@enduml